      "sourceTextSha256": "680ee27716b2df2c3c3b53458a380e78f0515e3ae57fe22891274b9771ce6b1a",
      "text": "After breakfast, at the scheduled time, a private driver will transfer you from your hotel to Oaxaca International Airport. The private airport transfer is included in the programme.\n\nOn request, you can continue your journey in Mérida, explore Chiapas with a stopover in Mexico City, or visit the Riviera Maya and then continue to Mérida. These extensions are arranged separately and are not included in the price of this 5-day programme.",
